        "listenerPort":{"type":"integer","minimum":1024,"maximum":65535}
      },"description":"Explicit permission for child-created 127.0.0.1 listener and loopback UP; two fixed output accepts require IPv4 TCP 127.0.0.1->127.0.0.1 with source or destination equal this port. Exact signed manifest/settings/start and actual same-child owner are mandatory. No blanket loopback accept."}
